WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.080
Principal,

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.120
Futoshi,

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.250
Ayu,

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.220
Tatsuya,

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.720
and Mom...

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:13.290
I set out that day, promising to save Yuzu 
and end the interdimensional war...

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.330
Now I'm in City, in the Synchro Dimension,

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.660
participating in a duel tournament.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.760
I know that nothing I say now will reach you,

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.600
but someday, I want you all to know

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.080
what's happened to us since we left.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.590
D-Wheels.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.800
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.910
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.030
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:25.990
King's Gambit

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:31.110
We headed for the Synchro Dimension, 
in order to fight Academia.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.670
But Sawatari, Serena, Layra, and I

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.410
were separated from the others.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.910
Right after our arrival, the town police,

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.580
known as "security," declared us fugitives.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:55.180
At first, I thought it was only

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:59.030
more reckless young people causing trouble.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:07.340
But when we were pursuing 
those youngsters, I noticed...

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.840
Two of the girls had the same face.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.810
They had just cornered us, when we were saved

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.780
by Crow Hogan and his friends.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:33.480
Crow told us about City's two types of people.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:38.010
The winners, Tops, and the losers, Commons.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.860
Tops monopolized the city's wealth and power,

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:46.240
and if the Commons did anything 
to speak out against them...

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.570
It's security! Run! We're surrounded!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.720
We arrested them, and they turned out 
to be duelists from another world.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:09.530
I separated the girl who used Fusion 
Summoning from the others,

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:12.860
and personally investigated her.

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:19.210
Whence did she come, and what 
was she doing in City?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.840
Of course, I wanted to quickly 
acquire the other girl, as well.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.520
The one wearing an Academia uniform.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.850
I'd learned that security had targeted Yuzu, when...

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.710
Weren't you posting the weird fliers with that girl?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.660
About some kind of invasion 
from another dimension?

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.250
Yuzu?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:47.230
In order to save Yuzu, I joined Crow's 
friends' plot to escape from jail,

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.800
and we broke out of prison.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.410
Wait for me, Yuzu. I'm coming.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:01.260
I arrived at the prison while they were 
in the middle of their little jail break.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:08.380
We managed to easily capture them all, but...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.840
Reiji Akaba claimed that he led a team of eight

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:21.010
to our dimension from one known 
as the Standard Dimension.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:25.630
Their goal was to fight the Fusion 
Dimension's Academia,

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:29.640
which seeks to control the four dimensions:

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.020
Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, and Standard.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.600
As we have not yet been invaded by Academia,

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.640
they hoped to forge an alliance with us.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:49.030
But we already knew of Academia's existence.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.330
Ten years ago, after Enjoy 
Chojiro's arrest for fraud,

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.590
order in City fell apart.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.800
And Tops and Commons became 
more opposed than ever.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.440
To improve relations,

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.410
the Administrative Council initiated 
two countermeasures.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:10.960
The first was to hold a duel tournament 
known as the Friendship Cup,

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.420
to promote harmony between Tops and Commons.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:19.130
The other was to open the Public Order Bureau,

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:23.110
to preserve the safety of the Tops 
and strengthen security.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:25.610
And one of our greatest weapons

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.960
was something that, up to that point, 
hadn't existed in our world,

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.240
Solid Vision with mass.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.440
In other words, the Real Solid Vision System.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:39.680
The one who brought it to us 
was Jean Michel Roget.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.640
He used that achievement to 
quickly springboard himself

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:46.120
to the position of director of 
the Public Order Bureau.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:50.320
Of course, we knew that he had 
come from outside our world.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.290
But even if he is plotting invasion...

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:59.470
...we decided to tame Roget and use him

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:02.000
to maintain public order.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.230
However...

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:10.940
That's when Reiji Akaba and the others 
came to warn us about the war's threat.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.650
If they made trouble and Academia learned of it...

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:19.480
...it could alarmingly hasten our 
own dimension's invasion.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:24.670
Even so, we could not simply ignore 
what Reiji Akaba had to say.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.390
As long as the mole known as Roget was around,

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.360
the threat from Academia was real.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:35.080
That is when we decided to weigh 
the two against each other.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.540
In other words...

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:42.140
If Reiji Akaba's Lancers could prove 
they had the power to protect us,

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.610
we would take their side.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.020
If not, we would make nice with Roget

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:50.520
and extend a hand of friendship 
to Academia through him.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:54.670
There was a reason I asked Yuya Sakaki

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:59.020
to be the king's opponent the night 
of the opening ceremony.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:04.170
I wanted to see how he would deal with Yuya 
Sakaki, who uses the previously unknown

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.760
summoning method Pendulum.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:13.000
The king, an enemy I must someday 
beat... Jack Atlas!

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:19.610
The first Commons-born winner 
of the Friendship Cup,

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:24.680
and the undisputed champion in the three 
years since, reigning as King of Duelists,

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:25.950
Jack Atlas.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.850
I was matched against him, 
City's greatest superstar.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:33.100
He provoked me by saying 
he'd beat me in three turns.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.190
And I completely lost my head.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.430
I'll show him how I entertain!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.140
And the finish...

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:49.480
Go, Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:52.220
Attack Jack Atlas directly!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:57.460
You mentioned having an entertainment 
duel, didn't you?

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:01.990
But your way of dueling is mere self-satisfaction.

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:04.690
It is a far cry from entertainment!

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.130
Synchro Summon!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.760
The raging soul...

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.420
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.870
Then, I attack directly with 
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:22.840
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:29.900
I lost... My confidence and my pride 
were stomped to pieces.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.700
Then Mr. Tokumatsu suddenly 
appeared before me

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.740
and told me something shocking...

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.900
As an example to others,

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.980
those who lose in the Friendship Cup are 
sent to an underground waste facility.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.930
Yuzu, whom I finally got to see, safe and sound...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:51.430
Mr. Tokumatsu and all my other allies...

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.570
I don't want to see any of them unhappy.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:02.270
What this tournament does is wrong!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:06.300
But no matter how I tried to tell the people,

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.170
they wouldn't listen.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:11.050
If you win, you gain everything.

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.290
If you lose, you lose everything.

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:17.060
Naturally, no one among the Tops 
or even the Commons,

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.900
had any problem with this competitive society.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:22.770
And I, provoked by them...

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.180
No... This isn't right.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.460
This isn't the type of duel I believe in!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.250
Afterward, Tsukikage, who'd replaced 
Layra in the tournament

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.950
and was sent underground, contacted me.

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:45.700
He told me that Gongenzaka, Sawatari, 
and Mr. Tokumatsu were safe.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.630
He passed on a message from Layra 
about what Jack had said.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:52.600
We came here to save this world.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:57.180
But no one in this dimension believes that.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:59.690
They don't believe in the power of the Lancers.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.340
To make them believe,

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.910
we have to beat Jack!

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.950
If you're trying to accomplish something...

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.110
Do not falter!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.860
"Yuzu... I finally realized.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.360
The reason my voice wouldn't carry, 
no matter how I screamed.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.970
And the reason Jack said my duels 
were just about self-satisfaction.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:30.800
In order to charm the people, engage them, 
and make them smile,

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.240
I need to get the viewers to acknowledge me.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:35.640
To achieve that...

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.980
I have to beat Jack!"

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.100
I'll win!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.770
With my style of dueling!

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:48.120
And I'll bring true smiles back to 
the hearts of City's people!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.840
As I made that promise,

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:54.830
I watched the fierce battle between 
Dennis and Kurosaki.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:59.310
And I heard the shocking revelation 
that Dennis was from Academia,

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:05.740
and was involved in the abduction 
of Kurosaki's little sister, Ruri.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.850
We don't want to cause any more trouble.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.440
Without fighting anyone, and without 
receiving anyone's aid...

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:20.000
...we wish to preserve order in City in its 
current form, as much as possible.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.690
That's what we want. Is it not, chairman?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.210
Yes.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:28.110
We do not wish you to bring

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.160
this dangerous-sounding interdimensional 
war to our world.

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:35.440
I see. But keeping me locked up

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.770
won't stop Dennis from reporting to them.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:43.240
I know that. It is merely insurance.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.340
More than one person from Academia is here.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:53.300
We shall take Dennis into custody before 
they can work together to plot anything.

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:55.770
We shall not hand him over.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:01.860
Wait.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.450
Dennis Mackfield is hereby

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.060
under Administrative Council control.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.850
Hand him over immediately.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.340
We won't allow this!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.300
Dennis is ours!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:17.110
That's a direct order from Public 
Order Bureau Director Roget!

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:23.010
The Administrative Council has decided 
to suspend Roget's authority.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:27.490
That negates the orders you received.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:39.370
Dennis disappeared!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.460
What's going on?

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.980
I won't let the Administrative Council have Dennis!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.740
Find him at once!

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.320
Suspend my authority?

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:56.790
If those old-timers wish to try it, then I 
shall have to use force, as well.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.810
Attention, all security.

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.190
Initiate operation...

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.100
King's Gambit!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.400
Security...

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.850
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.580
What's happening here?

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.730
The meaning, you ask?

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:10.680
That is what I would like to know.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.560
Roget?

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:16.410
To suspend the authority of the 
Public Order Bureau's director...

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.270
Do you think you can preserve the 
peace of City in such a manner?

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.740
The situation has changed.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:27.740
We don't know what might happen 
if you began working with Dennis.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.950
You think I'd call Academia here?

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.000
That might be amusing, it's true...

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.300
But it would serve no purpose for me.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.220
Do not falter!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.310
If I called them,

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:48.090
Academia would simply crush City underfoot...

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:54.990
And then what would be the 
point of all my preparations?

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:55.850
Preparations?

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:56.800
What are you saying?

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.780
What else?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.830
My preparations to take control of City.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:03.870
Control...

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:04.780
...of City?

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:09.480
Rather, City is already under my control.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.530
Right now, in all substantial manners,

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.990
the Public Order Bureau controls City.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:19.620
Not your Administrative Council at all!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.900
If City is truly a competitive 
society, it stands to reason

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.930
that those with power should stand 
at the top, in both name and fact.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.170
Am I wrong?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:38.330
You're saying that bringing Real Solid Vision 
and using it to enhance security

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.150
was all for this purpose?

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:46.250
Yes. Now, the only remaining task 
is to topple City's symbol, its king.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.190
For that purpose, I have prepared a piece.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:55.360
Dennis's appearance and your 
actions have hastened this.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:17:01.000
I shall allow the Friendship Cup to 
proceed normally, so don't worry...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:06.200
Until this is all over, I want 
you to stay there quietly.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.910
Control City?

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:13.390
In other words, you intend to 
rebel against Academia,

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.880
to build your own kingdom in 
the Synchro Dimension?

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.710
Kingdom?

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.850
I like the sound of that...

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:25.320
Yes, I do not intend to serve anyone else.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:28.690
Not even Professor Leo Akaba!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.160
Reiji Akaba,

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.240
the moment you appeared, I realized

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.400
that you were Leo Akaba's son.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:42.200
But you are your father's enemy.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:46.180
What do you think? The enemy 
of my enemy is my friend.

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:47.850
Why don't we work together?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.550
Control City together?

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.090
Nonsense.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.530
Partnering with someone who'd be 
satisfied with a single metropolis

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.760
would be of no benefit to me at all.

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.380
What was that?

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:08.310
Talk big for now...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.540
We'll see how long it lasts.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.520
The Administrative Council is crushed.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.700
Even if their forces find Dennis first,

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.980
they can do nothing now!

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:29.950
What I should fear more is that 
Dennis will cross dimensions,

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:34.810
and tell Leo Akaba about Serena 
and Yuzu's presence in City.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:40.460
If he does, the Professor will surely 
send someone to apprehend them.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:44.200
Yes, that man Joeri!

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:52.180
If that happens, my plan to keep 
City for myself will be exposed.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:57.790
Taking Dennis into custody is 
the key to my plan's success!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:03.980
Where am I?

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.750
You're finally up?

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:08.460
You are...

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.880
Sora Shiunin.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.800
A duelist from Academia.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:26.480
That's right... I remember.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.980
You're also from Academia.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.700
I was surprised to see you here, too.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.450
And that you were involved 
in the incident with Ruri.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.450
The incident?

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.750
I was just completing my mission. That's all.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.530
Then, if I can just bring Yuzu 
and Serena to Joeri—

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.040
I'll do that.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:47.030
You get back to Academia fast.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:49.000
What are you talking about?

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:54.000
The Professor ordered me directly 
to bring Serena back.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.740
This is my job.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.980
I know the reason you worked 
with Yuya and the others

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.430
was to keep an eye on Serena.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.900
But in your condition, you can't 
do anything more.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.850
If I hadn't saved you, you'd have been arrested.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.700
So get back quickly.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.790
Return to Academia and tell the Professor

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.500
that I will see through the 
mission I've been given.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.940
From Dennis's report, after his return,

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:40.150
Serena and Yuzu Hiiragi are in a place 
called City, in the Synchro Dimension.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:43.400
The moment the Obelisk Force's 
preparations are complete,

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.120
deploy them to the location.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.140
Yes, sir.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:50.090
I am grateful for the opportunity 
to restore my lost honor.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.300
Joeri will soon arrive. Work with him.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.180
No.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:57.030
Before he does,

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:01.010
I will capture Serena and Yuzu, 
and return with them.

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:04.420
I'm counting on you, Barrett.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:09.950
It's morning of the Friendship Cup's third day.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.450
Today will be the second round's four matches.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:18.890
I don't yet know who I'll be fighting,

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:24.090
but I'm sick of duels of hatred, like the 
one Kurosaki and Dennis fought.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.630
I'll use the entertainment duels, 
inherited from my father,

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:30.260
to bring smiles to everyone's faces!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:37.580
And I'll beat Academia, put an end 
to the interdimensional war...

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:41.180
...and we'll return to everyone.

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:47.860
Dad, Yoko, Futoshi, Ayu, Tatsuya...

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:52.330
I'll come home safely, along with Yuya.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.090
Yuzu Hiiragi...

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:58.930
She will be your opponent in the second round.

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:04.890
She and Serena will make fine trump cards 
to use when erecting my kingdom.

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:07.670
You must defeat her and bring her to me.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.160
Understand?

00:23:49.460 --> 00:23:52.250
It's time for the Friendship Cup's third day.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:55.550
The course was destroyed in yesterday's 
fight between Dennis and Kurosaki,

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:59.380
so beginning today, we'll hold the riding 
duels outside the Duel Palace!

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:03.380
Yuya tried to convince people that 
this tournament is wrong.

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:07.660
I want to convince people of the terror 
of the oncoming dimensional war.

00:24:07.660 --> 00:24:11.020
I'll fight this duel with all I have, and I'll win!

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:14.730
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Beauty of Destruction.

00:24:15.190 --> 00:24:17.180
The fun is only getting started!
